# DressMe — deploy overlay

Platform promote/OIDC: `app-deploy`.

- Site workflow: `.github/workflows/deploy-dressme.yml`.
- Deploy when `dressme/**` or that workflow changes (or `workflow_dispatch`); `tests/**`-only pushes skip S3/CDN.
- Sync `dressme/`: HTML `max-age=60`; JS/CSS `max-age=31536000, immutable` (bump `?v=` or hashed assets on change). Then CloudFront `/*` + Cloudflare URL purge for `SITE_HOST`.
- Playwright cache under `~/.cache/ms-playwright` keyed by `@playwright/test` version.
- Dependabot groups: Actions; Playwright under `tests/`; `@aws-sdk/*` under `infra/lambda`.
